{"id":8859639873735,"title":"Desert Cactus Printed Quilt Set, Vibrant Cactus \u0026 Flower Quilt","handle":"desert-cactus-printed-quilt-set-vibrant-cactus-flower-quilt","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the vibrant beauty of the desert into your home with this stunning Jeminise cactus and floral printed quilt set. Featuring a delightful blend of bright and bold colors, this quilt set is perfect for adding a touch of nature-inspired vibrancy and coziness to any bedroom decor.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVibrant Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Features a lively array of cacti and flowers in rich, bold colors to add a pop of nature-inspired beauty.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCustomization Options:\u003c\/strong\u003e Personalize your quilt set by selecting from various sizes, adding pillowcases, or including a name to make it uniquely yours.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Offered in Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90''), Queen (90\"x90''), and King (102\"x91\") to fit your needs.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eThoughtful Gift:\u003c\/strong\u003e An unique and thoughtful gift for cactus lovers, home decor enthusiasts, or anyone who appreciates vibrant and cheerful bedding.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e Machine washable for easy cleaning and low-maintenance upkeep, ensuring lasting freshness and convenience.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVersatile Use:\u003c\/strong\u003e Perfect for indoor and outdoor use, providing warmth in all seasons, and can be used as a bed quilt, picnic mat, or throw blanket.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eProduct Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eBrand\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eJeminise\u003c\/td\u003e\n